WEBVTT

00:01:43.590 --> 00:01:45.860
Portside field generator has been hit!

00:01:45.860 --> 00:01:48.530
Our barrage is too slow!
Let 'em have it for real!

00:01:48.530 --> 00:01:51.630
We are now at T-plus 5 minutes
since operation entered phase two.

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:55.130
All diversionary units are attacking
the giant deutera zone Sabato.

00:01:55.770 --> 00:01:58.410
Mission resource consumption now at 18 percent.

00:01:58.410 --> 00:01:59.900
Losses: 6 percent!

00:02:02.610 --> 00:02:04.650
What's the condition of the Oceanus?

00:02:04.650 --> 00:02:08.100
They are 20 seconds behind schedule.
Within tolerances.

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:10.890
Enemy formation
detected at 1 o'clock!

00:02:10.890 --> 00:02:13.120
They will contact the
Oceanus in 90 seconds!

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:16.920
30 degrees to starboard!
G.A.S.P.R. cannon, stand by to fire!

00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:18.690
We won't hit them at this range!

00:02:18.690 --> 00:02:22.790
Doesn't matter. I just want the enemy
to turn their attention to us. FIRE!

00:02:32.770 --> 00:02:36.040
Enemy formation has changed course.
They appear to be attacking the Cagayan.

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:38.710
Hold this course.
Maintain speed.

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:42.640
Be still my heart.
I've gotten used to us being the decoy.

00:02:43.150 --> 00:02:46.720
300 seconds to Arctic core
server deutera zone radius.

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:48.120
Where's the Altair?

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:50.460
Currently recharging its Q.L....

00:02:59.800 --> 00:03:01.200
Commander...

00:03:05.840 --> 00:03:08.370
All right!
We can move in at any time now!

00:03:11.450 --> 00:03:12.610
Kyo...

00:03:12.610 --> 00:03:14.620
What's wrong, Kaminagi?

00:03:14.620 --> 00:03:17.640
Nothing. It's nothing...

00:03:23.730 --> 00:03:25.160
Kyo...

00:03:25.390 --> 00:03:28.730
The next time we touch,
we'll both be real.

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:31.800
Let's make sure this operation is a success!

00:03:32.030 --> 00:03:33.470
Kyo...

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:37.200
<i>I want us to be real, too. Together...</i>

00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:40.440
120 seconds to Sabato radius!

00:03:41.710 --> 00:03:42.900
It's huge.

00:03:43.550 --> 00:03:46.010
Final adjustments have been completed.

00:03:46.010 --> 00:03:47.500
It's nearly time.

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:48.450
Yeah.

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:53.320
So, you really think
this'll be the end for us?

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:54.860
I do.

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:56.450
<i>The moment this is finished, so am I.</i>

00:03:57.790 --> 00:04:00.630
Fleet has begun to advance in order.

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:03.060
Oceanus is now 60 seconds
from Sabato radius.

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:05.430
Ezaki Perforator, stand by!

00:04:05.830 --> 00:04:08.360
Isolation field has been phase synched.

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:10.410
Passing through shock wave.

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:12.700
That data we grabbed from
the Anti-Zega was correct.

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:17.770
Penetrating shock wave!
All hands, brace for impact!

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:19.980
Penetration initiated!

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:38.600
We're through!

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:41.500
Radar, back on line!
Enemy units, all around us!

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:43.270
Zegapains, launch!

00:04:43.270 --> 00:04:44.300
ENTANGLE!

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:54.720
Well, well! We're getting the grand welcome!

00:04:54.720 --> 00:04:57.340
Then let's make our response just as grand!

00:05:01.620 --> 00:05:04.520
Thanks for coming out to greet us!

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:10.290
Three units to our right!
Two units to our left!

00:05:10.530 --> 00:05:12.500
Their firepower to our left is thinner.

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:13.560
I'll take both sides at once!

00:05:17.970 --> 00:05:20.070
Our objective is the quantum portal!

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:24.710
Limit our attack to anything blocking
our flight path! Ignore everything else!

00:05:28.020 --> 00:05:31.080
All ships have successfully
penetrated the deutera zone.

00:05:31.290 --> 00:05:35.810
All right! That's our cue to head for space
and take out the enemy orbital base "Cloud."

00:05:36.420 --> 00:05:38.450
<i>We're counting on you, Oceanus.</i>

00:05:55.680 --> 00:05:56.640
Where's the Oceanus?!

00:05:56.640 --> 00:05:59.370
It'll arrive at the core server any minute now!

00:06:00.050 --> 00:06:03.350
Quantum weaponry reaction on radar.
Antiaircraft cannons!

00:06:03.720 --> 00:06:05.350
Move to support the Oceanus!

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:08.090
Commander, the Deukalion
isn't advancing fast enough.

00:06:08.090 --> 00:06:09.060
What?!

00:06:17.570 --> 00:06:20.400
That's... The Anti-Zega Coatlicue!

00:06:35.880 --> 00:06:39.380
Weak! They commit to an all-out
attack with this level of force?

00:06:39.820 --> 00:06:42.690
Have you given in to despair,
lightless ones?!

00:06:45.790 --> 00:06:48.060
Where is Yehl's ship?

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:50.090
Headed towards the
Castle Where Light is Born.

00:06:52.070 --> 00:06:55.060
The foe I must defeat here
is Kyo Sogoru!

00:06:55.170 --> 00:06:57.640
And I want to see
Ryoko Kaminagi again!

00:06:59.710 --> 00:07:01.470
All portside turrets, fire!

00:07:04.950 --> 00:07:06.210
Out of my way!

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:07.980
You shall not pass!

00:07:08.150 --> 00:07:10.410
Route all of our Q.L.
to our antiaircraft cannons!

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:15.790
It's started?!

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:18.960
Now entering firing range
of enemy antiaircraft guns!

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:21.720
According to the data,
in area J-18...

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:24.660
there's an underground Q.L.
reactor supplying energy.

00:07:25.100 --> 00:07:28.190
Penetration mines!
Target area J-18!

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:30.600
Deep Throat bunker busters, FIRE!

00:07:44.050 --> 00:07:45.750
Q.L. reactor, knocked out.

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:48.090
That should weaken
their counterattack!

00:07:48.090 --> 00:07:50.180
Zegapain, all units!
Commence attack!

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:58.900
Wasn't their counterattack supposed to be weaker?!

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:01.300
<i>They're keeping it running for</i>
<i>the moment on auxiliary generators!</i>

00:08:01.470 --> 00:08:03.060
Warn me next time!

00:08:10.850 --> 00:08:12.110
Commander!

00:08:12.110 --> 00:08:14.980
Mission... progress?

00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:18.150
Which one?!

00:08:18.150 --> 00:08:21.620
Range 1200 at 10 o'clock!
Through the wall to the left!

00:08:21.620 --> 00:08:22.320
Roger!

00:08:30.330 --> 00:08:34.360
This is... The secret of
Abyss and Sin's immortality?!

00:08:36.540 --> 00:08:38.840
You make life a plaything?!

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:41.900
Never come back to life again!

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:53.420
Quantum portal, detected.

00:08:53.520 --> 00:08:55.220
It's straight ahead!

00:08:56.620 --> 00:08:58.420
There it is! Inside there!

00:09:01.900 --> 00:09:03.900
It's been sighted!
Rendezvous with them!

00:09:03.900 --> 00:09:04.870
Right!

00:09:04.870 --> 00:09:05.920
Roger!

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:27.020
This is... the quantum portal.

00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:30.290
The doorway to G-Phaetus!

00:09:33.430 --> 00:09:36.120
The moon... Time to go back.

00:09:45.910 --> 00:09:47.770
Why are they obstructing us?

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:53.080
I understand!
They're after G-Phaetus!

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:55.240
They intend to go to the moon?

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:57.150
Activate quantum portal!

00:09:57.350 --> 00:09:58.910
Initiating transmission sequence!

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:01.820
Using the enemy's quantum portal means...

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:04.780
<i>We'll be right in the middle of the</i>
<i>enemy when we go to the moon.</i>

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:07.160
<i>Look sharp, everyone.</i>

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:10.230
Ryoko, this will be your first
time fighting in low gravity.

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:11.560
Be ready for
the increased speed.

00:10:11.700 --> 00:10:13.360
Right, Shizuno-sempai.

00:10:13.570 --> 00:10:16.640
<i>Just stick with Lu-shen</i>
<i>and me and you'll do fine!</i>

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:19.110
Thanks, May-yen.

00:10:19.310 --> 00:10:21.900
<i>You do that on purpose, don't you?!</i>

00:10:24.980 --> 00:10:27.680
Huh? Why are you all laughing?

00:10:27.880 --> 00:10:30.050
Materialization probability flux, stabilized.

00:10:30.050 --> 00:10:33.120
Gards-orm quantum portal
has been synchronized.

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:34.450
Oceanus, transmit.

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:36.150
ENTANGLE!

00:10:43.230 --> 00:10:45.430
Anti-Zega is charging in.

00:10:45.430 --> 00:10:47.500
They seem to have
caught on to our diversion.

00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:48.630
Never mind, just hit them!

00:10:52.140 --> 00:10:53.610
Even if we die here,
don't let him through!

00:10:57.950 --> 00:10:59.780
If I die, I get through!

00:11:04.590 --> 00:11:06.550
Impossible! He'd die with us?!

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:18.470
You will not stop us!

00:11:18.470 --> 00:11:19.520
Abyss!

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:37.990
What happened to us?

00:11:37.990 --> 00:11:39.980
Kyo, look!

00:11:42.820 --> 00:11:45.460
The Earth... Which means...

00:11:45.460 --> 00:11:47.450
We've made it to the Moon!

00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:52.630
This is... G-Phaetus.

00:11:54.470 --> 00:11:56.530
This feeling...

00:11:57.170 --> 00:11:58.930
This isn't my first time here!

00:12:01.680 --> 00:12:02.970
Kyo!

00:12:04.610 --> 00:12:06.780
Forget it for now!
We're on a mission!

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:07.980
Incoming!

00:12:10.220 --> 00:12:11.380
I have control!

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:22.130
Hazonmeyers!

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:23.490
They're in use up here?

00:12:26.170 --> 00:12:28.160
Like I'd let you shoot?!

00:12:30.340 --> 00:12:32.170
No problem!

00:12:32.170 --> 00:12:35.800
Looks like they never expected
G-Phaetus to be attacked from within.

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:38.670
That was the essential point
of this operation!

00:12:40.520 --> 00:12:42.280
Mission phase three!

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:44.490
We make contact
with Shima's original!

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:45.850
But how?!

00:12:45.850 --> 00:12:48.150
Apparently, the commander
will show us the way.

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:50.980
Commander Shima!

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:57.730
Down this shaft at the very bottom
is the server room.

00:12:57.730 --> 00:13:00.790
A large number of
servers are stored there.

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:04.810
One of them in there...

00:13:04.810 --> 00:13:08.400
is the server under
my original's control.

00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:09.510
Minato.

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:10.500
Yes?

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:12.570
Could you hail Kyo for me?

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:19.580
<i>Kyo. I've burdened you with a
lot of terrible tasks. I'm sorry.</i>

00:13:19.790 --> 00:13:23.020
Cut it out. It's bad luck to
sound like you're about to die.

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:27.180
I couldn't choose the means
to meeting our objectives.

00:13:27.260 --> 00:13:28.700
You know that, right?

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:30.030
<i>Oh, enough with this!</i>

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:33.490
<i>I'm not gonna let you be</i>
<i>all cool and then die, okay?!</i>

00:13:33.670 --> 00:13:37.470
<i>If you go and die, I'll strip you down to</i>
<i>your underpants and draw on your face!</i>

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:38.370
Kyo!

00:13:39.910 --> 00:13:42.770
I wanted to see that kind of spirit
in your school activities, too.

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:51.780
I've always worked on research
into meta-body resurrection.

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:54.280
Use my body.

00:13:54.820 --> 00:13:58.260
If the program is perfected, then... Minato.

00:13:58.260 --> 00:14:00.660
Your missing data could be repaired, too.

00:14:00.660 --> 00:14:02.030
Commander...

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:04.830
Make contact with my original.

00:14:04.830 --> 00:14:06.860
Once you do, the path will be opened.

00:14:09.300 --> 00:14:11.070
Enemy silhouette detected,
dead above us!

00:14:14.610 --> 00:14:15.800
Bastard!

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:26.990
An Anti-Zega?!

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:28.560
Is that a new model?

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:29.750
Abyss and Sin?!

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:31.850
How did they get here?!

00:14:32.090 --> 00:14:35.220
Detecting superior Q.L.
quantity to the Coatlicue!

00:14:36.460 --> 00:14:39.370
Designating new unit
as Anti-Zega Mindi!

00:14:39.570 --> 00:14:42.240
Mindi is increasing its output!

00:14:42.240 --> 00:14:43.830
Minato.

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:44.910
Hurry.

00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:45.840
High-speed descent!

00:14:50.510 --> 00:14:52.340
Pathetic lightless ones!

00:14:57.280 --> 00:14:58.910
That thing's powerful!

00:15:11.330 --> 00:15:12.730
He anticipated where we'd dodge him?!

00:15:13.570 --> 00:15:15.670
Aim for the gaps in his light armor!

00:15:15.670 --> 00:15:18.070
Density distribution scan!
Precision sniping mode!

00:15:21.840 --> 00:15:23.970
Don't get full of yourself
just 'cuz you're new!

00:15:38.090 --> 00:15:40.420
What is this place?

00:15:43.560 --> 00:15:46.230
Is this... the server room?

00:15:51.710 --> 00:15:54.340
These guys don't even care if
we fight in their own back yard!

00:15:57.810 --> 00:16:00.410
Kyo, we're running out of Q.L.!
What do we do?!

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:01.620
It's too soon!

00:16:01.620 --> 00:16:03.120
It's no use! We're out!

00:16:04.590 --> 00:16:05.390
Lu-shen!

00:16:05.390 --> 00:16:06.420
Returning to base!

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:08.020
Kaminagi, we're headed back!

00:16:08.020 --> 00:16:09.490
Entangle, time out!

00:16:12.430 --> 00:16:13.550
Lu-shen!

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:33.480
They disappeared?!

00:16:33.480 --> 00:16:35.180
What's going on?!

00:16:35.380 --> 00:16:36.350
Kyo!

00:16:43.090 --> 00:16:44.960
Therefore,
while an outside observer...

00:16:44.960 --> 00:16:47.760
can always perceive the
quantum state of consciousness,

00:16:47.760 --> 00:16:52.870
- <i>...it is impossible for an outsider to extract that as data.</i>
- Where's the Anti-Zega? Where's Kaminagi?!

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:54.900
Aside for the Gards-orm, of course.

00:16:56.170 --> 00:16:58.370
Oh, come on. Loosen up!

00:16:58.370 --> 00:16:59.610
Kurage!

00:16:59.610 --> 00:17:02.640
Or perhaps this is more to your liking.

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:03.970
Omizu!

00:17:04.350 --> 00:17:07.210
I'll be whomever you want to talk to.

00:17:08.350 --> 00:17:08.950
Kyo.

00:17:08.950 --> 00:17:10.220
Lu-shen!

00:17:10.220 --> 00:17:13.490
I think we're inside the enemy quantum server.

00:17:13.490 --> 00:17:14.360
What?!

00:17:14.360 --> 00:17:16.960
The Zegapains were quantized along with us?

00:17:16.960 --> 00:17:18.650
They can do that?

00:17:18.790 --> 00:17:21.560
Please don't be so emotional.

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:23.530
I just wanted to talk to you.

00:17:31.240 --> 00:17:33.340
You're Naga, aren't you?

00:17:33.340 --> 00:17:34.360
He is?!

00:17:34.510 --> 00:17:37.340
You're correct, although incorrect as well.

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:40.280
Naga no longer exists as an individual.

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:41.040
What?!

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:46.350
Naga long ago merged himself with the
dataspace of the quantum server network.

00:17:46.350 --> 00:17:50.350
Naga once even existed within your own servers.

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:53.230
In a way, you can say that we're all Naga.

00:17:54.160 --> 00:17:57.390
What you're seeing is an interface
to allow me to talk to you.

00:17:57.600 --> 00:18:01.430
In other words, you're the acting
supreme commander of the Gards-orm?

00:18:01.840 --> 00:18:05.330
Not quite correct, but think of me
like that if it helps you to understand.

00:18:06.340 --> 00:18:08.410
You destroyed mankind!

00:18:08.410 --> 00:18:10.880
Perhaps that's true.

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:14.440
This form seems to be the most
psychologically stabilizing for you.

00:18:15.250 --> 00:18:18.020
In the beginning, Naga created
the quantum computer...

00:18:18.020 --> 00:18:20.540
in pursuit of limitless possibilities.

00:18:20.690 --> 00:18:21.810
Please observe.

00:18:21.920 --> 00:18:24.290
This is a record of the moment of a star's death.

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:28.390
At the end of the star's life span,
it explodes into a supernova.

00:18:28.900 --> 00:18:32.420
The gases created from it will then
coalesce and form another star.

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:36.540
The life span of a star is billions of years.

00:18:36.540 --> 00:18:41.910
And when you think about trying to observe
proton decay, that takes even longer.

00:18:41.910 --> 00:18:44.310
That's why a meta-body is so convenient.

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:46.980
If you connect a server
with a transmission device,

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:50.110
it becomes possible to traverse even
the vast distances between stars.

00:18:51.620 --> 00:18:54.990
So, you turned the Earth into
hell to pursue your interests?!

00:18:55.120 --> 00:18:57.920
It's not hell.
It's a nation of gods!

00:18:58.360 --> 00:19:00.160
Without bodies of flesh to tie us down,

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:04.030
wouldn't an observer see that
we, who are now immortal,

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:05.970
are no different than gods?

00:19:07.400 --> 00:19:11.210
Flesh and blood humans are
essentially quantum aggregations.

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:13.140
Even when you replace
them with quantum data,

00:19:13.140 --> 00:19:15.840
they can still carry on
the same activities of life.

00:19:16.140 --> 00:19:18.480
Eternal perfection.

00:19:18.650 --> 00:19:20.380
Infinite order.

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:23.650
Within accelerated time
and a controlled environment,

00:19:23.650 --> 00:19:26.180
our evolution will proceed
in an efficacious manner.

00:19:26.320 --> 00:19:30.950
At the cost of 7 billion lives and the
history amassed by the human race!

00:19:31.260 --> 00:19:33.120
That's hardly a major problem.

00:19:33.930 --> 00:19:37.800
Because we will build a new
history as a new race of mankind!

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:40.870
And what about the feelings
of the people you wiped out?!

00:19:40.870 --> 00:19:43.800
Don't you understand the pain you
caused to everyone who died?!

00:19:43.940 --> 00:19:46.460
Unfortunately, I didn't.

00:19:48.210 --> 00:19:52.510
My originals were born
without the ability to feel pain.

00:19:54.110 --> 00:19:56.250
But I understand it now.

00:19:56.250 --> 00:20:01.880
The example structure of a reconstructed pain
sensation is returning that function to me!

00:20:02.890 --> 00:20:07.830
I see. This "pain" sensation
is an effective danger signal.

00:20:08.130 --> 00:20:12.720
Feeling this stimulus drives
your self-preservation instinct.

00:20:13.370 --> 00:20:17.570
You oppose us in order
to avoid feeling this pain!

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:19.370
No. You don't get it.

00:20:20.840 --> 00:20:23.740
What we're talking about
is the pain in our hearts!

00:20:24.350 --> 00:20:25.810
The city we cherish...

00:20:25.810 --> 00:20:27.150
The people we love...

00:20:27.150 --> 00:20:28.710
The memories we treasure...

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:31.480
The pain in our hearts from losing them...

00:20:32.150 --> 00:20:33.880
I swear, I'll never forget it!

00:20:34.320 --> 00:20:36.520
I won't let a guy like you
erase it from me!

00:20:36.860 --> 00:20:39.090
Don't misunderstand us.

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:42.630
What we seek is evolution,
not destruction.

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:45.000
We're giving you a choice.

00:20:45.330 --> 00:20:46.500
What?!

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:51.060
You Cerebrants are a hybrid
we didn't foresee in our crop.

00:20:51.210 --> 00:20:55.400
The arising of a new factor gives
birth to a new evolutionary pattern.

00:20:55.840 --> 00:20:58.910
How about it?
Why not join us?

00:20:58.910 --> 00:21:02.980
We possess the physicalization
technique you desire.

00:21:02.980 --> 00:21:05.250
In the form of Reconstructants.

00:21:05.350 --> 00:21:09.620
Now, make your choice.
What will you do?

00:21:10.090 --> 00:21:11.230
Kyo...

00:21:11.230 --> 00:21:12.390
Kyo!

00:21:13.390 --> 00:21:15.420
I don't know.

00:21:15.630 --> 00:21:20.190
I don't know if your offer
has any advantages to it.

00:21:20.700 --> 00:21:25.170
But in my fists,
in the biceps in my arms...

00:21:25.170 --> 00:21:27.000
In my <i>soul,</i> I'm enraged!

00:21:28.580 --> 00:21:30.880
I hate you!

00:21:30.880 --> 00:21:33.750
No matter what, I'll never join you!

00:21:35.550 --> 00:21:39.780
Negotiations have broken down!

00:21:53.300 --> 00:21:57.740
Us, join up with Naga?!
You gotta be kidding! I'm <i>me!</i>

00:21:59.640 --> 00:22:01.630
And you...

00:22:01.910 --> 00:22:04.880
I'LL NEVER FORGIVE YOU!!!

00:22:51.690 --> 00:22:53.920
Resurrection has failed.

00:22:54.190 --> 00:22:56.030
The Oceanus has gone silent.

00:22:56.100 --> 00:22:58.120
Shima wanders endlessly.

00:22:58.600 --> 00:23:01.500
Yet Kyo still struggles on.

00:23:02.340 --> 00:23:06.860
In the end, do I really live my life
according to my feelings, just like him?

00:23:07.540 --> 00:23:08.640
Kyo...

00:23:08.640 --> 00:23:11.040
Tell everyone what you've seen!

00:23:11.880 --> 00:23:15.080
Next time, on Zegapain: "A Droplet of Light."

00:23:15.420 --> 00:23:18.290
My pain, never to be forgotten.
